sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Vehicle agent
  participant P as Path A alert
  participant Au as Audio arbiter
  participant S as Car speakers
  A->>Au: spoken answer · normal priority
  Au->>S: playing the answer
  P->>Au: critical alert
  Au->>S: cut the answer within 100 ms, play the alert
  Au-->>A: answer dropped — stale
  P->>Au: the same warning again, too soon
  Au-->>P: refused · RATE_LIMITED
